[
  {
    "comment": "【认证方式】账号密码登录。任务里保存 username 与 password，每次运行先用它们登录换新会话，再执行每日奖励；Cookie 变量可以留空（登录成功后由会话自动接管），User-Agent 保持与浏览器一致即可。\n\n【本模板做什么】处理高清影视之家固定每日奖励流程：\n1. 打开登录页取 formhash，用账号密码登录换取新会话；\n2. 打开首页确认本人登录并提取 UID；\n3. 读取积分规则中的“每天登录”记录，判断今天是否已推进；\n4. 只有今天尚未推进时，才检查已完成任务并申请固定红包任务 id=12；\n5. 不自动重试、不发帖、不操作其他任务。\n\n【成功判定】必须确认同一 account_uid 的每日登录记录，且日志中至少出现“今日登录已确认”、任务申请成功或本期已申请等可验证状态；所有状态缺失时失败关闭。\n\n【失效处理】账号密码错误、站点返回安全验证或人机验证，以及页面结构不再符合预期时，任务会失败关闭，不会伪造成功。密码变更后只需在任务里更新 password 变量。\n\n【补充说明】页面出现安全验证、人机验证、滑块或返回登录页时直接失败，不会推断红包已经领取。",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://10001.baidubaidu.win/member.php?mod=logging&action=login",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{user_agent}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "no-cache"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "name=[\"']formhash[\"']\\s+value=[\"'][0-9A-Za-z]+[\"']|action=logout",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "安全验证|人机验证|拖动[^\\n]{0,20}滑块|验证码",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "formhash",
          "re": "name=[\"']formhash[\"']\\s+value=[\"']([^\"']+)[\"']",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "用账号密码登录换取新的 discuz_2132_auth 会话。成功后本次运行全程使用新会话，不再依赖会过期的 Cookie；站点返回“您已经登录”时同样视为可用会话。",
    "request": {
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "https://10001.baidubaidu.win/member.php?mod=logging&action=login&loginsubmit=yes&handlekey=login&inajax=1",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{user_agent}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9"
        },
        {
          "name": "Content-Type",
          "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
        },
        {
          "name": "X-Requested-With",
          "value": "XMLHttpRequest"
        },
        {
          "name": "Referer",
          "value": "https://10001.baidubaidu.win/member.php?mod=logging&action=login"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "no-cache"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "formhash={{formhash|urlencode}}&referer=https%3A%2F%2F10001.baidubaidu.win%2F&loginfield=username&username={{username|urlencode}}&password={{password|urlencode}}&questionid=0&answer=&cookietime=2592000",
      "mimeType": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "/succeedhandle_login|您已经登录|欢迎您回来/i",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "密码错误|密码空|包含非法字符|登录失败|验证码|安全验证|次数过多|请稍后再试|账号被|禁止访问|表单验证|抱歉",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": []
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "打开首页确认本人登录并提取 UID；登录会话由前面的账号密码步骤提供。",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://10001.baidubaidu.win/",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{user_agent}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "no-cache"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "/(?=[\\s\\S]*action=logout)(?=[\\s\\S]*discuz_uid\\s*=\\s*[\"'][1-9]\\d*[\"'])/i",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "安全验证|人机验证|请完成[^\\n]{0,20}验证|拖动[^\\n]{0,20}滑块|验证码",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "re": "请在登[陆录]账号后继续访问网站|用户登录页面|请先登录|member\\.php\\?mod=logging(?:&amp;|&)action=login",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "account_uid",
          "re": "discuz_uid\\s*=\\s*[\"']([1-9]\\d*)[\"']",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "读取当前账号的积分规则记录，只接受唯一“每天登录”行及其可验证时间；今日已记录时不进入任务中心",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://10001.baidubaidu.win/home.php?mod=spacecp&ac=credit&op=log&suboperation=creditrulelog",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{user_agent}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9"
        },
        {
          "name": "Referer",
          "value": "https://10001.baidubaidu.win/"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "no-cache"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "/(?=[\\s\\S]*action=logout)(?=[\\s\\S]*discuz_uid\\s*=\\s*[\"']{{account_uid}}[\"'])(?=[\\s\\S]*<tr[^>]*>(?:(?!<\\/tr>)[\\s\\S])*每天登录(?:(?!<\\/tr>)[\\s\\S])*\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}\\s+\\d{2}:\\d{2})/i",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "安全验证|人机验证|请完成[^\\n]{0,20}验证|拖动[^\\n]{0,20}滑块|验证码",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "re": "请在登[陆录]账号后继续访问网站|用户登录页面|请先登录|member\\.php\\?mod=logging(?:&amp;|&)action=login",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "reward_date",
          "re": "/(?=[\\s\\S]*每天登录)[\\s\\S]*?(\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2})/i",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "把奖励日期中与当前上海日期相同的值替换为内部标记 today_ok；只用于决定是否需要红包兜底",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "api://util/string/replace?r=text&t=today_ok&p={{1|date_time(1,0)|urlencode}}&s={{reward_date|urlencode}}",
      "headers": [],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": ".+",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "reward_state",
          "re": "(.*)",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "name": "reward_today",
          "re": "(today_ok)",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "把仍为非 today_ok 的奖励日期替换为内部标记 pending；页面缺失日期时不会进入红包分支",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "api://util/string/replace?r=text&t=pending&p=%5E%28%3F%21today_ok%24%29.*%24&s={{reward_state|urlencode}}",
      "headers": [],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": ".+",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "needs_redpacket",
          "re": "(pending)",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "仅在“每天登录”奖励今天尚未推进时进入固定红包任务分支",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{% if needs_redpacket == \"pending\" %}",
      "headers": [],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [],
      "failed_asserts": [],
      "extract_variables": []
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "读取当前账号的已完成任务页，确认每日红包是否已经领取；已领取时不再申请",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://10001.baidubaidu.win/home.php?mod=task&item=done",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{user_agent}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9"
        },
        {
          "name": "Referer",
          "value": "https://10001.baidubaidu.win/home.php?mod=spacecp&ac=credit&op=log&suboperation=creditrulelog"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "no-cache"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "/(?=[\\s\\S]*action=logout)(?=[\\s\\S]*discuz_uid\\s*=\\s*[\"']{{account_uid}}[\"'])/i",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "安全验证|人机验证|请完成[^\\n]{0,20}验证|拖动[^\\n]{0,20}滑块|验证码",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "re": "请在登[陆录]账号后继续访问网站|用户登录页面|请先登录|member\\.php\\?mod=logging(?:&amp;|&)action=login",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "redpacket_ok",
          "re": "/(?=[\\s\\S]*action=logout)[\\s\\S]*?(【每日任务】论坛每日红包)/i",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "name": "redpacket_pending",
          "re": "/(?=[\\s\\S]*action=logout)(?![\\s\\S]*【每日任务】论坛每日红包)[\\s\\S]*?(暂无任务)/i",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "仅在已完成任务列表没有今日红包时执行一次固定任务 id=12 的申请",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{% if redpacket_pending == \"暂无任务\" %}",
      "headers": [],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [],
      "failed_asserts": [],
      "extract_variables": []
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "申请高清影视之家固定每日红包任务 id=12；只接受站点明确的申请成功或本期已申请结果，不自动重试",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://10001.baidubaidu.win/home.php?mod=task&do=apply&id=12",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{user_agent}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept-Language",
          "value": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9"
        },
        {
          "name": "Referer",
          "value": "https://10001.baidubaidu.win/home.php?mod=task&item=done"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "no-cache"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "任务申请成功|申请成功|恭喜您申请成功|已申请|本期您已申请过此任务.*?下期再来",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "安全验证|人机验证|请完成[^\\n]{0,20}验证|拖动[^\\n]{0,20}滑块|验证码",
          "from": "content"
        },
        {
          "re": "请在登[陆录]账号后继续访问网站|用户登录页面|请先登录|member\\.php\\?mod=logging(?:&amp;|&)action=login",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "redpacket_ok",
          "re": "(任务申请成功|申请成功|恭喜您申请成功|已申请|本期您已申请过此任务.*?下期再来)",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "固定红包任务申请条件结束",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{% endif %}",
      "headers": [],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [],
      "failed_asserts": [],
      "extract_variables": []
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "每日登录奖励分支结束",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{% endif %}",
      "headers": [],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [],
